cator":"bookmark:E00051","source_text":"","role":"body","panel_id":"P87","source_ref_ids":["EV00051"],"verification_status":"verified"}],"notes":"Native source occurrence; actual static and visual checks separate."},{"element_id":"E00052","element_type":"source_line","metadata_pointer":null,"occurrences":[{"occurrence_id":"E00052O","docx_locator":"bookmark:E00052","source_text":"Data Source: Data Listing 16.x.x.x","role":"source_line","panel_id":"P87","source_ref_ids":["EV00052"],"verification_status":"verified"}],"notes":"Native source occurrence; actual static and visual checks separate."},{"element_id":"E00053","element_type":"footnote","metadata_pointer":"/footnotes/0/exact_text","occurrences":[{"occurrence_id":"E00053O","docx_locator":"bookmark:E00053","source_text":"Note: For hematology parameter, baseline of cycle 1 is defined as the last valid value on or prior to the first date of chemotherapy. The baseline of each cycle in cycle 2-4 is defined as\nthe last valid value on or within 3 days  prior to the first date of chemotherapy of each cycle.\nPercentages are based on the number of non-missing subjects from Safety Analysis Set at each visit in each treatment group.\n.","role":"footnote","panel_id":"P87","source_ref_ids":["EV00053"],"verification_status":"verified"}],"notes":"Native source occurrence; actual static and visual checks separate."},{"element_id":"E00054","element_type":"programming_note","metadata_pointer":null,"occurrences":[{"occurrence_id":"E00054O","docx_locator":"bookmark:E00054","source_text":"Programming notes:1. For hematology parameter, “Day 1 of cycle xx” is not as a analysis visit, its value is included in the baseline analysis of each cycle.\nVisits not specified in the study flow chart will not be summarized in table.\n2.Repeat for all hematology parameters: White blood cell count (10^9/L ), Neutrophil count (10^9/L ), Eosinophil count (10^9/L), Basophil count (10^9/L ) etc.\n3. Please use \"Baseline of cycle xx\" for baseline of each cycle.","role":"programming_note","panel_id":"P87","source_ref_ids":["EV00054"],"verification_status":"verified"}],"notes":"Native source occurrence; actual static and visual checks separate."}],"occurrence_relations":[],"issues":[]}
